cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'eb-staged-rebuild: rebuild a live EasyBuild install and swap it in'
message: If you use eb-staged-rebuild, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
- given-names: Rohit
  family-names: Goswami
  email: rgoswami@ieee.org
  orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2393-8056
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/stackhands/eb-staged-rebuild
url: https://stackhands.github.io/eb-staged-rebuild/
keywords:
- EasyBuild
- HPC
- atomic deployment
- rollback
abstract: Rebuilds an EasyBuild install in a generation directory under a state
  root, then exchanges the finished tree with the live software directory and publishes
  the module file, with journals, rollback and garbage collection; shipped as a
  Python package and a static Zig binary.
